    "body": "Starting an entirely new PR without any reference to the old one, and putting your name and not mine in the acknowledgements doesn't look like you didn't mean not to acknowledge me.\r\n\r\nI trust the reviewers to do a good job reviewing the text here - I've said my piece on the design of the feature in the past, rehashing that seems pointless at this stage.",
